# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The Pixel 8a's Wi-Fi: why iOS says "offline" (NSURLErrorDomain -1009) for minutes though en0 has its address (TODO 35e,
# boot-args pcie=5 pcie_delay=60 wifi=8): every 20 s what SCNetworkReachability says, what configd keeps under
# State:/Network/Global (the primary service, IPv4, DNS), and a fetch -- side by side until it comes online.
/redwood/bin/net_test waitaddr en0 150
/redwood/bin/net_test reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20 reach www.apple.com store State:/Network/Global/.* fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html wait 20
